  "bodyHash": "12a903ad2f8a0a9f",
  "content": "<p>模组列表：</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/third-life\" rel=\"nofollow\">3rd Life</a> - 你只有三条命。</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/antique-atlas\" rel=\"nofollow\">Antique Atlas</a> - 添加了一部用于在暮色森林中导航的古董地图。（建议关闭坐标显示）</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/antique-waystones\" rel=\"nofollow\">Antique Waystones</a> - 在古董地图中添加传送石。如果传送石在暮色森林中毫无用处，可能会在未来的更新中移除。</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/appleskin\" rel=\"nofollow\">AppleSkin</a> - 让你看到饱和度数值。</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/bed-benefits\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bed Benefits</a> - 睡觉有益健康！</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/bookshelf\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bookshelf</a> - Bed Benefits 的依赖项。</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/bountifulbaubles\" rel=\"nofollow\">BountifulBaubles</a> - 添加了一些有用的物品！</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/chat-heads\" rel=\"nofollow\">Chat Heads</a> - 这样你就能在聊天栏中看到朋友们的头像了！</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/chunk-animator\" rel=\"nofollow\">Chunk Animator</a> - 远处的区块会动态加载出现。</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/foxs-combat-shovels\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fox's Combat Shovels</a> - 别问。</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/corpse\" rel=\"nofollow\">Corpse</a> - 添加尸体。与 Curios 兼容。</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cosmetic-armor-reworked\" rel=\"nofollow\">Cosmetic Armor Reworked</a> - 添加了装饰性盔甲槽位。</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/creativecore\" rel=\"nofollow\">CreativeCore</a> - ItemPhysics Full 的依赖项。</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/curios\" rel=\"nofollow\">Curios API (Forge)</a> - 额外槽位的 API，BountifulBaubles 和 Curious Armor Stands 的依赖项。</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/curious-armor-stands\" rel=\"nofollow\">Curious Armor Stands</a> - 为盔甲架添加 Curios 支持。</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/dimensional-spawn\" rel=\"nofollow\">Dimensional Spawn</a> - 初始世界出生点位于暮色森林。</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/dynamic-music\" rel=\"nofollow\">Dynamic Music</a> - 为了氛围感。</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/dynamic-surroundings\" rel=\"nofollow\">Dynamic Surroundings</a> - 添加了一些环境音效。</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/enchanted-book-redesign\" rel=\"nofollow\">Enchanted Book Redesign</a> - 根据附魔类型改变附魔书的样式。</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/enchantment-descriptions\" rel=\"nofollow\">Enchantment Descriptions</a> - 令人惊讶的是，它适用于大多数附魔模组。</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/geode\" rel=\"nofollow\">Geode</a> - 添加基于矿石类型的僵尸。</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/itemphysic\" rel=\"nofollow\">ItemPhysics Full</a> - 物品掉落效果更美观。</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/jei\" rel=\"nofollow\">Just Enough Items (JEI)</a> - 查看物品和配方。</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/lock-on\" rel=\"nofollow\">Lock On</a> - 锁定敌人，实现更酷炫的“RPG”风格战斗。</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/not-enough-animations\" rel=\"nofollow\">Not Enough Animations (Forge)</a> - 酷炫的动画，与第一人称模型兼容。</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/rereskillable\" rel=\"nofollow\">Rereskillable</a> - Reskillable 移植到 1.16.5 的版本。</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/shoulder-surfing-reloaded\" rel=\"nofollow\">Shoulder Surfing Reloaded</a> - 酷炫的过肩视角。</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/simple-world-timer\" rel=\"nofollow\">Simple World Timer</a> - 一个告诉你当前是 Minecraft 第几天的计时器。专为 100 天挑战设计。</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/snow-pig\" rel=\"nofollow\">Snow Pig (Forge)</a> - 猪猪 brrrrr（指快速移动）</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/sodium-reforged\" rel=\"nofollow\">Sodium Reforged</a> - Optifine 的替代品，因为 Optifine 与暮色森林兼容性不佳。</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/spartan-weaponry\" rel=\"nofollow\">Spartan Shields</a> - 史诗般的盾牌等物品。</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/spartan-weaponry\" rel=\"nofollow\">Spartan Weaponry</a> - 史诗般的剑等武器。</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/spawner-fix\" rel=\"nofollow\">Spawner Bug Fix</a> - 修复刷怪笼的一个 bug。</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/spiders-2-0\" rel=\"nofollow\">Spiders 2.0</a> - 当你偶尔在暮色森林中看到蜘蛛时，那将会是恐怖的体验。</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/swingthroughgrass\" rel=\"nofollow\">SwingThroughGrass</a> - “草挡路了”。</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/transliterationlib\" rel=\"nofollow\">TransliterationLib</a> - First-Person Model 和 Not Enough Animations 的依赖项。</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/the-twilight-forest\" rel=\"nofollow\">The Twilight Forest</a> - 核心模组。</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/two-players-one-horse\" rel=\"nofollow\">Two Players One Horse</a> - 非常酷。</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/unique-enchantments\" rel=\"nofollow\">Unique Enchantments</a> - 1.16.5 版本绝对最好的附魔模组（大概吧）。</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/waystones\" rel=\"nofollow\">Waystones</a> - 酷炫的传送装置。不过不确定它们是否适用于暮色森林。</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/waystones\" rel=\"nofollow\">WeaponThrow</a> - 这样你就可以投掷战斗铲了。</p>",
